  {
    label: 'Talk to Rob signal',
    value: 'Out-of-state transplants from Mobile, NOLA, Keesler, or "we vacationed in 30A and want quieter" are the most common Ocean Springs inbound. Rob lives here. The market intel is current.',
  },
