      <p class="sources-note"><strong>Verified May 2026.</strong> School district structure, historic-district scope, and FEMA-zone patterns cross-checked against city, district, MDE, and FEMA sources. Specific parcel-level flood zones, school attendance boundaries, and millage rates change — verify against current sources before counting on a number for a specific address. Next planned refresh: after the 2026–27 school accountability ratings are published and after any FEMA map revisions.</p>
